        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Viscous Choke"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal, water)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe fuath surrounds the head of one air-breathing creature within 30 feet in a magical film of viscous water for 1 minute. The target must succeed at a DC 17 Reflex save or begin to choke and must hold their breath to avoid drowning (Core Rulebook 478). The film can be temporarily wiped away with a total of 3 Interact actions by the choking creature or creatures adjacent to it, allowing a new Reflex save with a +2 circumstance bonus to end the effect. (These actions don't need to be consecutive or made by the same creature.)"
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
